# Vercel CLI upload rules for the raffle demo dApp.
#
# Deployments are PREBUILT (`vercel deploy --prebuilt`), so the only tree the
# CLI ever uploads is `.vercel/output`. This file exists so the CLI does not
# fall back to .gitignore, which excludes `dist/` — the build this deployment
# is made of.
#
# The entries below only bite if someone runs a non-prebuilt `vercel deploy`.

node_modules
.env
.env.local
